|passage=He gives his '''dog'''-Mota or '''dog'''-Fiji in exchange for Pigeon English.}}
#: {{ux|en|That modification turned his Dodge hemi into a '''dog'''.}}
## {{lb|en|film}} A [[flop]]; a film that performs poorly at the [[box office]].
